  "Id": "dda268e8-fed6-4137-b21d-56ed907e3a51"/*StairCombineSDF*/,
  "Description": "Combines two or more SDFs so that the seams become stairs, columns, grooves or tongues.\n\nSee also: [CombineSDF]",
  "SymbolTags": "8",
  "InputUis": [
