      "InputId": "2607bb4f-a9cc-4289-9404-841c12a03e96"/*K*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 45.0
      },
      "Description": "Size of the stair or column region in world units. For Groove and Tongue it is the depth."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "750c399c-9f8c-4bcd-8d5d-a7e26d6510c0"/*CombineMethod*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 45.0
      },
      "Description": "Union, Difference and Intersection with columns or stairs. Groove cuts a carpenter-style groove into the first field where the following fields cross it, Tongue adds a ridge."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "d5dc3fe0-3b7d-4afb-a941-8e632ed80ae2"/*Steps*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 120.0
      },
      "Description": "Number of steps or columns. For Groove and Tongue it is the width."
    },
